cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use VoltHub CSMS in your work, please cite it using this
  metadata.
title: VoltHub CSMS — two-engine EV charging management system
authors:
  - alias: humoge7502
    name-suffix: Krishna Puri
note: >-
  Two-engine EV charging platform: Oracle 23ai money path (29 relations,
  7 PL/SQL packages), TimescaleDB telemetry (hypertables, caggs,
  compression, retention), OCPP 1.6J gateway with simulator fleet,
  outbox-relay join, race-tested in CI on both engines.
repository-code: https://github.com/humoge7502/VoltHub-CSMS
url: https://humoge7502.github.io/VoltHub-CSMS/
abstract: >-
  An open reference implementation of an EV charging management system
  (CSMS) demonstrating production patterns for ACID billing/reservation
  (Oracle PL/SQL), immutable telemetry (TimescaleDB hypertables),
  effectively-once cross-engine pipelines (transactional outbox +
  ack-after-COMMIT relay), and an OCPP 1.6J WebSocket gateway.
keywords:
  - csms
  - ev-charging
  - ocpp
  - oracle
  - plsql
  - timescaledb
  - outbox-pattern
  - race-testing
  - ci-cd
license: MIT
